<title>USA: Global DirectMail to sell Compaq computers.</title>
<headline>Global DirectMail to sell Compaq computers.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global DirectMail Corp said Thursday it had been authorized to sell Compaq Computer Corp's line of Presario personal computers at its new outlet store in suburban Chicago.</p>
<p>Global said its 12,000-square-foot store in Naperville offers several computer brands in addition to the Compaq line.</p>
<p>Global is a direct marketer of computers, office and industrial supplies in North America and Europe.</p>
<p>Its stock was up 1/2 at 41-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
